    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46061" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">subsignātĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		subsigno, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a subscription</i>, <i>signature.</i>
			* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">veteres subsignationis verbo pro subscriptione
					uti solebant,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Dig. 50, 16, 39</span></i>
			.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>a firm promise</i>,
				<i>assurance</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">poenitentiae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tert. Poen. 2 <i>med.</i></span></i>
			</div>
